  "body": "This release includes:\r\n\r\n- **Inno Setup Unpacker - Windows GUI v 2.2.11**\r\n- **Inno Unpacker console version 2.67.11** suitable for setups made with Inno Setup up to version 6.7.3\r\n\r\nLast changes in Windows GUI:\r\n\r\n- Support of Windows Dark Mode\r\n- User selectable langugae\r\n\r\nLast changes in console version:\r\n\r\n- Support for setup files with long paths\r\n- Unpacking to long paths (> MAX_PATH = 260), also if specified as relative\r\n- Resolving _DiskSliceSize_ issue\r\n",
